   266	## The acceptance test — proportionate and finite
   267	
   268	Sol reviews this document against the claims table and residual-risk list, then the
   269	build proves, as executed attacks:
   270	
   271	1. An agent in the VM cannot read owner files, reach the host/tailnet/local network,
   272	   or find any reusable credential.
   273	2. Resource attacks (disk fill, fork bomb, memory, network flood) leave the Mac
   274	   usable.
   275	3. An agent cannot push, merge, or spend except through its broker; broker tokens
   276	   can't rewrite history, change repo settings or branch rules, publish releases or
   277	   packages, or touch any repo outside the allowlist.
   278	4. Tap-to-merge repos: nothing merges without the owner's authenticated tap —
